'''Saintly Sister (Merciless)''' is an [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] unlocked after clearing [[Dead by Encore]]. It was added in [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]] and appears on the '''3rd''', '''4th''', '''17th''', and '''18th''' of every month. Upon completion, players have a 30% chance to unlock [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Cossack Cat]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

